SUMMARY:Deadline 23:59 CET: ligeti zentrum Artists and Scientists in Reside
 nce 2027\, Where Sound Shapes Space (Hamburg\; EUR 1\,200 a month plus acc
 ommodation)
DESCRIPTION:Closes 10 Jan 2027 at 23:59 CET.\n\nFifth round of the ligeti z
 entrum's artistic-scientific residency in Hamburg. Each resident joins one
  of four running projects on sound and space.\n\nOrganisation: ligeti zent
 rum (Hamburg University of Music and Theatre\, HAW Hamburg and partners)\n
 Location: ligeti zentrum\, Hamburg-Harburg\, Germany. No nationality or ag
 e limit stated.\nAward: Scholarship of EUR 1\,200 net per month for the re
 sidency\, plus accommodation in Hamburg\, a workspace\, use of the Product
 ion Lab\, basic technical support and professional documentation. Travel i
 s not mentioned. No application fee mentioned.\nDuration: Three months\, A
 pril to end of June 2027\n\nMore: https://ligeti-zentrum.de/residency-2027
 /?utm_source=artificialnouveaugrantdesk&utm_medium=referral
